{"articleNo":"85057","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85057&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"yes구미 희망취업·창업 아카데미 1기 참가자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.14","hit":"4022","attachments":[{"name":"희망취업_창업 아카데미 1기 포스터.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85057&attachNo=71533"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">지역 청년실업자를 위한 직업교육훈련 및 취업지원 서비스 강화를 위해 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">경북경영자총협회가 구미시와 구미고용센터 그리고 대학 등 구미지역 일자리관련 기관들과 힘을 합쳐 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">'</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">구미 희망취업</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">창업 아카데미</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">'</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">를 개설하여 청년 구직자 여러분 초대합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><br><strong>◆ 교육기간</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013.06.26(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)~2013.06.27(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">박 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일 합숙교육<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>◆ 교육장소</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">팔공산 맥섬석유스호스텔<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>◆ 모집인원</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 40</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>◆ 모집대상</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">구직을 희망하는 미취업자 누구나 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">세 이상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>◆ 참가비용</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">무료<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>◆ 접수기간</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013.06.04(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)~2013.06.21(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br><br><strong>◆ 문의 및 신청</strong> : 경북경영자총협회(<a href=\"http://www.gbef.or.kr/\">http://www.gbef.or.kr</a>)</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 담당자 서윤미 / 054-461-5522 / 유선으로 접수&nbsp;<br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t